<p>So, this article still has a handful of spelling/grammatical errors that could have been found by a simple typing program. The anomaly itself is fine, and the pacing is fine too. The hook of the bird man in the discovery log foreshadows the secret logs pretty well. Overall the piece is solid, though I do find myself wondering why those symbols were added in at the bottom. They don't seem to serve much of a purpose to the article itself.</p>
